  "title": "Natalie&#39;s Amazing Irish Mashed Potatoes",
  "description": "These Irish mashed potatoes are light, fluffy, and rich, thanks to the addition of cream and butter. They&#39;re quick and easy to make for a tasty side.",
  "authors": [
    "Natalie Herr"
